            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 4,
              "start": 4
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Sotomayor asked: \u201cWhat\u2019s the limit of that power? \u2026 could Congress impose any kind of registration requirement for any federal conviction?\u201d"
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Scalia",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "bcf1e11cd0e8876e4b2c5d1df5ac02c370f72e8d42c343045d35f20067c846cf",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-bcf1e11cd0e8-0000-0003"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 7,
              "start": 7
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Scalia asked: \u201cI assume that applies to all Federal crimes, right? \u2026 can be subjected to whatever civil restraints Congress later decides?\u201d"
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Sotomayor",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "bcf1e11cd0e8876e4b2c5d1df5ac02c370f72e8d42c343045d35f20067c846cf",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-bcf1e11cd0e8-0000-0005"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 20,
              "start": 20
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Sotomayor later asked: \u201cWhat\u2019s promoted?\u201d"
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Sotomayor",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "bcf1e11cd0e8876e4b2c5d1df5ac02c370f72e8d42c343045d35f20067c846cf",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-bcf1e11cd0e8-0001-0000"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 27,
              "start": 26
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Sotomayor asked whether the United States is challenging the federal government\u2019s power to impose registration as part of a federal sentence."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Alito",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "bcf1e11cd0e8876e4b2c5d1df5ac02c370f72e8d42c343045d35f20067c846cf",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-bcf1e11cd0e8-0002-0000"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 39,
              "start": 39
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Alito asked: \u201cIs it your argument that Congress lacks the power to impose supervised release after the date when the person leaves the military?\u201d"
      }
    ],
